            "detailed_description": "There’s a big secret at Dr. Hugo’s Factory for Making Robots. When the inventors aren’t looking, their tiny robots go on big adventures. They never expected to stumble onto a plot so diabolical it threatened their very existence. With lasers.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tIt all starts when Zander - possibly the world’s most absent-minded inventor - trips over a metal box buried outside the factory. When no-one can figure out how to open it, the robots sneak out and try it for themselves. What they discover is the first step to a grand adventure, leading to a mystery as old as the factory itself.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tJoin the robots as they outwit mischievous children, curious animals, and dysfunctional inventors in their quest to find the truth. Will the robots solve the mystery before it’s too late?<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tFind out by visiting Dr. Hugo’s factory yourself!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as 5 different robots, each with their own abilities and quirky personalities<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Help the bots work together as a team to solve puzzles<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Bomb, burn, push and swim your way through 17 intricately designed levels<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Explore the hidden secrets of a crazy robot factory<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Unwittingly meddle in the humans’ lives</li></ul>",
